# dnf needs-restarting -r

Impact:

Applying updates may require restarting affected services or rebooting the system (for kernel and core-library updates) to take effect, causing planned downtime. Updates can also change behavior or introduce regressions, which is why testing on non-production systems and following a defined patch-management policy is recommended."
