Create or edit a file in the /etc/sysctl.d/ directory ending in .conf and edit or add the following line:
net.ipv4.conf.all.route_localnet = 0

Example

# [ ! -d \"/etc/sysctl.d/\" ] && mkdir -p /etc/sysctl.d/
