Impact:

Enforcing net.ipv4.conf.all.route_localnet = 0 prevents the host from routing or forwarding traffic destined to 127/8 . On systems that legitimately require this - for example a router, or a container/Kubernetes host where kube-proxy (or similar) sets route_localnet=1 - this recommendation may not be applicable; assess and document any such exception before enforcing."
